,"image_banner_hznBMn":{"type":"image-banner","name":"t:sections.image-banner.presets.name","settings":{"heading":"","full-width-enabled":false,"slide_height":"adapt_to_first_image","desktop_fixed_height":320,"mobile_fixed_height":460,"desktop_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/AQUI_ESTA_EL_DETALLE.png","desktop_text_vertical_position":"center","desktop_text_horizontal_position":"center","mobile_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/AQUI_ESTA_EL_DETALLE-responsivo.png","mobile_text_vertical_position":"center","mobile_text_horizontal_position":"center","color-heading":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","section-color-overlay":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","section-color-overlay-opacity":100,"color-body-text":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","text-container-color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","color-overlay-opacity":100,"margin-top":40,"margin-bottom":20}},"rich_text_iU9iLK":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_BneQfF":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"TEQUILA CANTINFLAS BLANCO 100% AGAVE","disable_on_mobile":false,"size_heading":150,"size_heading_mobile":130}},"text_GELnVz":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<h2>El espíritu de una leyenda mexicana<\/h2><p><\/p><p><strong>Tequila Cantinflas Blanco 100% de Agave es un tributo a la poesía del pueblo mexicano.<\/strong><br\/>Representa la unión entre tradición, orgullo y autenticidad: un tequila limpio, expresivo y profundamente ligado a nuestras raíces. Su perfil revela el alma del agave cocido, acompañado de notas cítricas y especiadas que envuelven los sentidos.<br\/><br\/>Un líquido honesto, creado para disfrutarse solo, en las rocas o en coctelería tradicional, dejando una huella imborrable en la identidad de México.<\/p><p><\/p>","disable_on_mobile":false}}},"block_order":["heading_BneQfF","text_GELnVz"],"custom_css":[".hero__title {font-family: \"celebrate\" !important ; color: #d9000d;}"],"name":"t:sections.rich-text.presets.name","settings":{"section_width":"regular","desktop_text_horizontal_position":"center","color-body-text":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","background_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","margin-top":20,"margin-bottom":20}},"features_banner_xGPNQw":{"type":"features-banner","blocks":{"image_PtXXgq":{"type":"image","settings":{"desktop_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/icono-vista2.png","select_icon":"bag","heading":"Vista","text":"<p>Transparente y brillante, con matices plateados; cuerpo medio-alto y textura sedosa.<\/p>","link":""}},"image_Ych8Ji":{"type":"image","settings":{"desktop_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/icono-aroma2.png","select_icon":"bag","heading":"Aroma","text":"<p>Agave cocido franco, notas cítricas (lima, limón), flores blancas, pimienta blanca y ligera mineralidad.<\/p>","link":""}},"image_Nnm7rE":{"type":"image","settings":{"desktop_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/icono-boca2.png","select_icon":"bag","heading":"Boca","text":"<p>Entrada limpia y seca; dulzor natural del agave, matices herbales y cítricos, sutil vainilla y especia fina.<\/p>","link":""}},"image_a66hWX":{"type":"image","settings":{"desktop_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/icono-final2.png","select_icon":"bag","heading":"Final","text":"<p>Fresco, equilibrado y persistente, con retrogusto placentero y coherente al olfato.<\/p>","link":""}}},"block_order":["image_PtXXgq","image_Ych8Ji","image_Nnm7rE","image_a66hWX"],"custom_css":["h1 {font-family: \"celebrate\" !important ;}",".wt-keys__title {font-weight: 800; color: #7b4922; font-size: 18px !important;}"],"name":"t:sections.features-banner.settings.presets.name","settings":{"heading":"","size_heading_mobile":80,"size_heading":80,"icon_width_mobile":36,"icon_width_desktop":64,"icon_layout":"left","columns_desktop":"4","icon_layout_mobile":"grid","color_body_icon":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","color_background_icon":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","color_body_text":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","background_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","margin-top":20,"margin-bottom":80}},"benefits_product_Jjt7GQ":{"type":"benefits-product","blocks":{"benefit_RedAec":{"type":"benefit","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/img-produccion-coccion-min.png","item_heading":"Cocción (50\/50)","text":"<p><\/p><p>50% en <strong>hornos de mampostería<\/strong> (~48 h) — cocción lenta que desarrolla notas profundas de agave cocido.<br\/>50% en <strong>autoclave<\/strong> (~16 h) — cocción controlada para consistencia y precisión en el punto de cocción.<\/p>"}},"benefit_hpUgtL":{"type":"benefit","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/img-produccion-molienda-extraccion-min.png","item_heading":"Molienda \/ Extracción","text":"<p><\/p><p>La fibra cocida se prensa en molinos tradicionales, extrayendo mieles ricas en azúcares que darán origen a mostos limpios y balanceados.<\/p>"}},"benefit_Lcj8Y8":{"type":"benefit","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/img-produccion-fermentacion-min.png","item_heading":"Fermentación","text":"<p><\/p><p>Llevada a cabo en tanques de acero inoxidable con levaduras seleccionadas que realzan el bouquet sensorial y la identidad del agave<\/p>"}},"benefit_rYPN8E":{"type":"benefit","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/img-produccion-destilacion-min.png","item_heading":"Destilación","text":"<p><\/p><p>Doble destilación en alambiques de acero inoxidable con interiores de cobre, permitiendo el contacto necesario para afinar y depurar el perfil aromático.<\/p>"}},"benefit_JPLNwf":{"type":"benefit","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/img-produccion-ajuste-embotellado-min.png","item_heading":"Control de Calidad","text":"<p><\/p><p>Se afina a 40% Alc. Vol. en presentación de<br\/>700 ml, con control de calidad certificado que garantiza la pureza y autenticidad de cada botella.<\/p>"}},"benefit_YMeQ7M":{"type":"benefit","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/produccion_resultado.png","item_heading":"Resultado","text":"<p>Un tequila blanco de gran cuerpo, suavidad excepcional y carácter definido.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["benefit_RedAec","benefit_hpUgtL","benefit_Lcj8Y8","benefit_rYPN8E","benefit_JPLNwf","benefit_YMeQ7M"],"custom_css":["h2 {font-family: \"celebrate\" !important ; color